      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我不太懂八重那样讲是什么意思。\n所以想说找你商量──",
      "source_fingerprint": "87879dbfa439ad324091d03035ad3d9863bef0efa2a930ae94260a64566e3fea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
