      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……小栗帽这位赛马娘\n被誉为“时代宠儿”的原因之一，\n是因为她活跃的领域相当“广泛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a3e51111803d99718c4994c7aaf093f8f75b4f17acc5652f195af2dd24ec5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
