      "uid": "zhcn:ad7daa6b4e1e48c34cb5d7cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从英里赛到长距离，至今她在距离多元的赛事中，\n发挥了无与伦比的强悍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dff03b1f1567c61fef2413975303504fb176fc98bb66436214d733d7bba1e49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
