      "uid": "zhcn:bb07931f9fd89caee26f95e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──举个例子，假设有个赛马娘对英里赛\n拥有绝对的信心，认为这段距离不会输给任何人，\n并且一路努力至今。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cfe19fc1dd3ea3c96df35ea87d3577d3cdab8bdbe70522e37d13fbed838d720",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931f7e0e049d984c6e9fb58e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她累积了实际的成果，\n也让外界认为“她或许是\n这个距离最强的赛马娘”时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a37c4ea36434304354cc94ae220b7d04f253023434ff000db42aac351636c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec3c35e2c725672b4eac77a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──忽然有个强大无比的赛马娘\n阻挡在她面前的话，会怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c28eb0138456f321cb2d9c3759166241830c701baf6bd32775065b1799f9fa6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb561ab6050bf8728b4f352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，如果那位赛马娘在其他距离\n也强得无可匹敌呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "381e0c1219445901140be27e3ca1e29a66263a70e512495dcea7897dbb06dec8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69535471030c1e36640fec85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这点令人觉得相当可靠，\n却也让我有点害怕正面交锋过后\n会有什么样的结果。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "01580c6a6f78def1b8d6b47bd9082f6f332c90a51682ce7276f9b377eb68e3d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a81bd61ab8eabf5dd4d04a83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那样一来，她就会像是耀眼至极的太阳\n在蓝天下遮住星星的光芒一般，\n把观众和竞争对手的认知给覆盖掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1addab0e6793aa90e1ab45242e58ba7edace04402946a4f5783647d5072fb422",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eddcd0dcb0efbee755ee2290",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“她是最强的”、\n“没人比得过她”、\n“无论什么比赛，她都一定会赢”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a760435ea4a1bf758228e8eaae46bea3820c57eded9a8147f750c7fd16dd53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c5afaa80fe8e3ba3234d21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而实际上，会让大家说出这种话的赛马娘──\n就是小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7753e3e102ed6a79185d6ef8ecf23dc68752955d5528868f7fa7d78dbe26f820",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c87bdc87a88380f9ab8469",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌可能就是因为察觉到这点……\n或是有过深刻的体悟，\n才会那样告诉青竹回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ed9f7e1ab645ba53c23fbfcff971e42aeffde479b1429bc13495304ebb07cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38980f6f64a9375909c1d153",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽在任何距离都很强大，\n且极其抢眼，正因为这样，\n她的光芒会盖过其他赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68aaf483d39abe942e078f5bf1f864aab66e095d6ce2517150044f9a635aa8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1f46edbdf40e9eeeb94d36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆",
      "source_fingerprint": "10c0e62c9c29b0c7110fc490d820aac2e1803271ecdde3830e065a1ed9bdb2d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053117.json",
